"A session opened from the tab menu replaces this window's tabs instead of opening a new window (the closed tabs come back with ⇧⌘T).": "從索引標籤選單開啟的工作階段會取代此視窗中的索引標籤，而不會開啟新視窗（已關閉的索引標籤可用 ⇧⌘T 找回）。",
"Type in the address bar of a new tab": "在新索引標籤的網址列中輸入",
"⌘T and the + button: type or paste a path at once.": "⌘T 與 + 按鈕：可直接輸入或貼上路徑。",
"Folders opened from other apps open in a new window": "從其他 App 開啟的資料夾會在新視窗中開啟",
"Off: they open as a tab in the front window.": "關：在最前面的視窗中以索引標籤開啟。",
"Right-click menu": "右鍵選單",
"Ask before deleting": "刪除前詢問",
"Only when deleting for good": "僅在永久刪除時",
"Warn when an extension changes": "變更副檔名時發出警告",
"Double-click empty space to go up": "在空白處雙擊即可返回上一層",
"Select the folder you came from when going up": "返回上一層時選取您來時的資料夾",
"Run programs from the address bar": "從網址列執行程式",
"Text that is not a place is looked for as an app (Terminal, Visual Studio Code…) or a program (code, make…) and started in the open folder.": "若輸入的文字不是位置，會將其視為 App（終端機、Visual Studio Code 等）或程式（code、make 等）尋找，並在目前開啟的資料夾中啟動。",
"Off: archives open in the app macOS chooses for them.": "關：壓縮檔會以 macOS 為其選擇的 App 開啟。",
"Compress in one click": "一鍵壓縮",
"The right-click menu’s Compress makes this format at once; the other formats and “Create archive…” stay below it.": "右鍵選單中的「壓縮」會直接建立此格式；其他格式與「建立壓縮檔案…」仍位於其下方。",
"Off: only the menu": "關：僅透過選單",
"The new folder opens in a new tab.": "新資料夾會在新索引標籤中開啟。",
"Sizes": "大小",
"The Size column shows each folder’s total, worked out in the background.": "「大小」欄會顯示每個資料夾的總大小，並在背景計算。",
"Show the size on disk for folders": "顯示資料夾佔用的磁碟空間",
"Type @name in the address bar to go to the folder.": "在網址列輸入 @名稱 即可前往該資料夾。",
"Add…": "加入…",
"Name for “%@”": "“%@”的名稱",
