"System colour": "系統色彩",
"Custom…": "自訂…",
"Example: %@": "範例：%@",
"No matching settings": "沒有符合的設定",
"rustyfiles on the same network find each other; files go encrypted straight from device to device, with no server or account. When you turn it on, macOS may ask to let rustyfiles find devices on your local network: allow it.": "同一網路中的 rustyfiles 會彼此找到；檔案會在裝置之間加密直接傳送，不需要伺服器或帳號。開啟後，macOS 可能會要求允許 rustyfiles 尋找本機網路上的裝置，請允許。",
"Can’t look for nearby devices": "無法尋找附近的裝置",
"Who can see this Mac": "誰可以看到此 Mac",
"Everyone lasts 10 minutes, then it goes back to trusted devices only. To take files from a device you haven’t paired with, or to pair with one, choose Everyone.": "「所有人」會持續 10 分鐘，之後恢復為僅信任的裝置。若要接收來自未配對裝置的檔案，或與其配對，請選擇「所有人」。",
"Look again": "重新尋找",
"Forgets the devices listed, looks for them again and announces this Mac again.": "忘記已列出的裝置，重新尋找，並再次向其他裝置宣告此 Mac。",
"rustyfiles must be open on the other device, with Ferry on. A device you haven’t paired with is listed only while its visibility is Everyone.": "另一部裝置上必須開啟 rustyfiles 並開啟 Ferry。未配對的裝置只有在其可見性為「所有人」時才會列出。",
"The speed test did not finish.": "速度測試未完成。",
"Other devices see this Mac by this name. Leave it empty to use the computer’s name.": "其他裝置會以此名稱看到此 Mac。留空則使用電腦名稱。",
